{
  "bookId": "hero-212017",
  "id": "bond-28587",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "28587001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "甄姬",
          "text": "找我何事？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28587003",
              "text": "我受人所托，想请你设计一件珠宝。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28587002",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28587003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "甄姬",
          "text": "很遗憾，我的时间已经排满了，恕我无能为力。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28587005",
              "text": "果然不行吗……"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28587004",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28587005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "甄姬",
          "text": "哦？看来委托之人对你很重要。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28587006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "甄姬",
          "text": "也罢，待我审查一番自己的计划表，或许能够调整一些事项。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28587007",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "片刻之后——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28587008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "甄姬",
          "text": "我向来重视检视珍珠品质一事，但它却相当繁琐且乏味。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28587009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "甄姬",
          "text": "若是有人能够替我承担此项工作，你的这个委托便能匀出空来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28587011",
              "text": "放心，交给我吧！"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "28587011",
              "text": "当然，我来搞定！"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28587010",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28587011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "甄姬",
          "text": "那么给我一刻钟的时间，我将提供初步的设计构想给你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28587013",
              "text": "真的吗？太感谢了！"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28587012",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28587013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "甄姬",
          "text": "无需言谢。\n为你调整计划，也是我计划中的一部分。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "28587",
